Package: com.gokuencinar.carrierfix.ios17test
Name: CarrierFix iOS 17 Test
Version: 0.4.0~ios17test2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Experimental Cricket/AT&T carrier overlay diagnostic and SMS/IMS repair validation build for jailbroken iOS 17. Creates and verifies a per-carrier backup before modifying the active overlay and supports one-tap restore.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 17.0), firmware (<< 18.0)
